---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/content';
---
<Layout title="Privacy information"><PageIntro eyebrow="Your information" title="A clear, simple approach to privacy." description="How this redesigned website handles information, and what happens when you contact the foundation or choose an external service." /><section class="section container prose">
  <h2>This website.</h2><p>This site serves static pages through Vercel. Its code does not include advertising trackers, visitor analytics, embedded social-media feeds, or a visitor account system. Vercel may process request information such as IP addresses and access logs when delivering pages. See <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy">Vercel’s privacy policy</a> for its practices.</p><p>Site search and project filters work in your browser. The code does not send search queries to an analytics service or store form drafts in browser storage. Search and filter terms may appear in the page URL, browser history, and ordinary hosting logs.</p>
  <h2>Email-draft helpers.</h2><p>Contact, volunteer, and impact-report fields are processed in your browser to prepare a message. This website does not submit those fields to a server. You choose whether to send the draft using your email app. Once sent, your message is handled by your email provider and the foundation’s email service.</p><p>Do not include card numbers, passwords, identity documents, or sensitive beneficiary information. A project inquiry is not a newsletter subscription.</p>
  <h2>Donations.</h2><p>Configured donation links lead to Give Lively pages published by the foundation. The provider processes payment and donor information under its own policies and terms. This website does not collect card details, issue receipts, or claim a payment succeeded. Historical donor accounts and payment history have not been copied into this site.</p><p>For older gifts, the service that originally processed the donation remains responsible for its payment record. Visit <a href="/donor-support/">donor support</a> for help finding the right next step.</p>
  <h2>Newsletter subscriptions.</h2><p>The original website published a Mailchimp form endpoint, but that destination was unavailable when checked. Until a working signup destination is supplied, the page offers an email inquiry. No subscriber list is collected by the website. If a hosted signup URL is configured, subscription and confirmation take place on that provider.</p>
  <h2>External resources.</h2><p>Videos, podcasts, newsletter archives, and external project pages open on their publishers’ platforms, with their own privacy practices. Images, map graphics, and fonts used on this website are served locally with the site.</p>
  <h2>Questions or requests.</h2><p>Contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> about information sent to the foundation. For a newsletter subscription or recurring gift, use the management instructions in the original provider’s confirmation email.</p><p class="source-note">This disclosure describes the implemented site. The foundation should confirm its own email retention and information-handling arrangements before the custom-domain launch.</p>
</section></Layout>
